OL,3,AStock up on food to prepare for extreme
OL,4,Aweather, minister says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHouseholds should stock up on food to
OL,7,Fprepare for extreme weather as the
OL,8,Fstrongest El Nino event in a generation
OL,9,Fdevelops over the Pacific Ocean, a
OL,10,Fgovernment minister has said.
OL,12,FEnvironment Secretary Dame Angela Eagle
OL,13,Ftold the Guardian the powerful natural
OL,14,Fclimate phenomenon will lead to "more
OL,15,Fextreme storms in this country".
OL,17,FHer comments came as the National Audit
OL,18,FOffice (NAO) warned Britain's food
OL,19,Fsupply chain is at risk given the
OL,20,Fgrowing threat of cyber-attacks and the
OL,21,Fclimate crisis.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,307,300,200,140,0,100
